# learned-bot (RL) training checkpoints — generated net weights + meta
rl-checkpoints/

# PPO scratch (bots/ppo) — a developer's own bundle/fixture tree: candidate
# checkpoints, uncompressed recorder output, symlinks into a training rig.
# The bundles the bots actually play are COMMITTED under public/bundles/, and
# the parity fixtures under bots/ppo/fixtures/; `PPO_BUNDLE_DIR` and
# `PPO_ASSETS_DIR` point at this scratch tree instead when it exists.
.ppo-assets/
